      "nets": ["PWM", "SDA", "SCK", "RST"],
      "observed": "Both an ATtiny45 (U2) and an ATtiny13 (U3) are connected to the same control and programming nets, including their PB1/PWM outputs, SDA/PB0, SCK/PB2, and reset pins.",
      "expected": "A fan controller should have one active MCU, or explicit isolation/selection between alternative MCUs. Independent MCU outputs should not be directly tied together.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"PWM\") ... (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"PB1\")) (node (ref \"U3\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"PB1\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"SDA\") ... (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"5\")) (node (ref \"U3\") (pin \"5\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"RST\") ... (node (ref \"U2\") (pin \"1\")) (node (ref \"U3\") (pin \"1\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If both MCU footprints are populated, their I/O drivers can contend, and shared programming connections can interfere. The board may not operate reliably.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["C2"],
      "pins": ["C2.1", "C2.2", "U1.2"],
      "nets": ["+5V", "GND"],
      "observed": "C2 is 100nF across the LM1117-5.0 output rail and ground, with no larger output capacitor shown.",
      "expected": "Use the output capacitance required by the LM1117 datasheet; 100nF alone is below the usual minimum needed for regulator stability.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C2\") (value \"100nF\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"+5V\") ... (node (ref \"C2\") (pin \"1\")) ... (node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"VO\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"GND\") ... (node (ref \"C2\") (pin \"2\")) ... (node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"1\") (pinfunction \"GND\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The regulator may oscillate or respond poorly to load transients, causing an unstable +5V rail for the controller and interfaces.",
      "confidence": 0.87
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist connects two separate MCUs directly to the same control and programming nets, creating a likely output-contention problem if both are assembled. The LM1117 output also has only 100nF of shown capacitance, which is typically insufficient for stability."
}

